WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.453
Cogram Relay is a collaboration workflow built on Cora Zeng's existing
Cogram.

00:00:04.453 --> 00:00:09.277
It lets a teammate receive selected source evidence instead of an
entire conversation.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.824
These are real excerpts from a public engineering trajectory corpus.

00:00:15.824 --> 00:00:18.501
Each retains its source file and line.

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:21.942
A relevant investigation excerpt is not a confirmed fix.

00:00:22.642 --> 00:00:27.044
The sender selects two complete quotes and adds a next step.

00:00:27.044 --> 00:00:31.046
The JSON preview includes a snapshot identifier and integrity hash.

00:00:31.046 --> 00:00:35.048
Its actual serialized size is eight hundred fifty two bytes.

00:00:35.048 --> 00:00:37.049
No quote is silently truncated.

00:00:37.749 --> 00:00:40.872
A fresh workspace imports that exact preview file.

00:00:40.872 --> 00:00:45.557
The receiver checks source text and pointers against the same corpus
snapshot.

00:00:45.557 --> 00:00:49.851
Two incoming sources are shown, while the local selection remains
empty.

00:00:51.749 --> 00:00:54.841
Only choosing Adopt selection replaces the local evidence set.

00:00:54.841 --> 00:00:59.652
The receiver now has the same two source records and the sender's next
step.

00:01:01.749 --> 00:01:04.505
Here a second file contains an altered quote.

00:01:04.505 --> 00:01:08.294
The import is rejected, and the two accepted records remain selected.

00:01:08.294 --> 00:01:13.116
A matching hash alone would not establish that a quote agrees with the
corpus.

00:01:13.816 --> 00:01:17.552
Changing the investigation clears stale evidence and the next step.

00:01:17.552 --> 00:01:23.529
An unknown query returns no matching sources, and export stays
disabled instead of inventing an answer.

00:01:24.229 --> 00:01:27.229
This prototype needs a shared public snapshot.

00:01:27.229 --> 00:01:30.229
Hashes prove neither authorship nor factual correctness.

00:01:30.229 --> 00:01:34.086
The new collaboration workflow builds on existing retrieval assets.

00:01:34.086 --> 00:01:39.658
Download completion was not independently verified; this demo imports
the saved preview bytes.

00:01:39.658 --> 00:01:45.229
This is an edited browser walkthrough with synthetic narration, not a
usability study.
